<title>POLAND: BPH APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 20.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 20.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 20.42 vs   23.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   40.95 vs   30.50</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 67.99 vs   56.02</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     105.15 vs   87.05</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 94.92 vs  105.97</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  146.32 vs  154.73</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		248.09 vs  223.97</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     394.64 vs  343.20</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank</p>
<p>Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
